@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h3>Day 26 — OLTP Overview and ACID Principles</h3>
<p class="lead">This demo shows what happens when database operations lack proper transaction boundaries.</p>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Demo Flow</h5>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Inventory</strong> — View current product stock (pre-seeded data)</li>
            <li><strong>Broken Checkout</strong> — Attempt a checkout without a transaction. Observe data corruption.</li>
            <li><strong>Safe Checkout</strong> — Same checkout wrapped in an explicit transaction. Data stays consistent.</li>
            <li><strong>Orders</strong> — View created orders to verify results</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</div>
